---
import DonateButtons from './DonateButtons.astro';
---

<section id="support" class="support">
  <div class="page-container support-inner">
    <p class="support-eyebrow silver-text">/ Support · Apoyar</p>
    <h2 class="support-heading">
      Built by <span class="gold-text">one developer</span>,
      in spare hours.
    </h2>
    <p class="support-lead">
      SEELE is built as a labor of love by
      <a
        href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career"
        rel="noopener"
        target="_blank"
      >Orlando Nahuel Vazquez Gonzalez</a>
      under DevZen SpA. If it saves you time, here are the ways to help:
    </p>

    <ul class="support-list">
      <li>
        <strong>Star · share</strong> the
        <a
          href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career/seele"
          rel="noopener"
          target="_blank"
        >repo</a>. Visibility brings contributors, contributors make the tool better for everyone.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Open issues</strong> with feedback or bug reports.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Hire · consult</strong> via a
        <a
          href="https://github.com/orlando-vazquez-career/seele/discussions"
          rel="noopener"
          target="_blank"
        >Discussion</a> if your team uses SEELE in production.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="donate-heading">
      <span class="gold-text">Crypto donations</span>
      <span class="silver-text">— one click</span>
    </h3>
    <DonateButtons />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .support {
    padding-block: clamp(var(--space-16), 8vw, var(--space-20));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--semantic-border-subtle);
  }

  .support-inner {
    container-type: inline-size;
  }

  .support-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-mega);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .support-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(var(--text-2xl), 5vw, var(--text-3xl));
    font-weight: var(--weight-black);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .support-lead {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--semantic-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .support-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-12);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .support-list li {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--semantic-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    padding-left: var(--space-4);
    position: relative;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .support-list li::before {
    content: '▴';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--semantic-text-gold);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .support-list strong {
    color: var(--semantic-text-primary);
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
  }

  .donate-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    color: var(--semantic-text-primary);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
  }
</style>
